{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05459","headline":"奉和圣制送张说巡边 · 席豫","name":"奉和圣制送张说巡边","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣主重兵权，分符属大贤。\n中军仍执政，丞相复巡边。\n翕习戎装动，张皇庙略宣。\n朝荣承睿札，野饯转行旃。\n亭障东缘海，沙场北际天。\n春冬见岩雪，朝夕候烽烟。\n已勒封山记，犹闻遣戍篇。\n五营将月合，八阵与云连。\n经略图方远，怀柔道更全。\n归来画麟阁，蔼蔼武功传。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"席豫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}